OL,3,AFood, fuel and taxes ` can the
OL,4,ADemocrats do anything to ease cost of
OL,5,Aliving pressures?
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo business owners, half a country
OL,8,Fapart, want the same thing for
OL,9,Fdifferent reasons.
OL,11,FIn Texas, Kim Hanks, who owns Tillies,
OL,12,Fa hotel, restaurant and spa business
OL,13,Fnear Austin, says rising grocery and
OL,14,Ffuel costs are forcing her to raise
OL,15,Fwages for her 300 staff.
OL,17,F"It's been such a moving target for us
OL,18,Fon affordability," she told the BBC
OL,19,FWorld Service.
